{"id":113,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":2,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"你恢复了清醒。回过头，海拉的隔离间已经被破坏，她瘫倒在地上，神色痛苦。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"海拉","content":"混蛋……混蛋……我要干掉你，一有机会，我就干掉你……","voice":["vo_cgplot_107003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"S-019","content":"她做不到的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_107004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"S-019看着你，她身旁的黑影此刻清晰地呈现在你面前，这就是那恐怖噩梦的真实形态，但你却不再感到恐惧。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"S-019","content":"被烙上<color=#fb9259>枷锁</color>的禁闭者，一切都将由你支配。","voice":["vo_cgplot_107006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"说着，她看向走廊的另一头——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"暴徒们已经追到了这边，被你们的动静吸引，叫嚣着冲了过来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"S-019","content":"你已经是真正的局长了，请给我命令。从今以后……我只需要你的命令。","voice":["vo_cgplot_107009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"选项","options":["清除他们"],"jump":[11],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"S-019","content":"明白。","voice":["vo_cgplot_107011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}